# LinkedBlocingQueue

**`LinkedBlockingQueue` 基于 "链表" 的阻塞队列**：这是一个 `有限队列 / 无限队列`

- `LinkedBlockingQueue`：是一个 `单向队列`，它的 Node 是一个 `单向链表`

  `LinkedBlockingDeque`：是一个 `双端队列`，它的 Node 是一个 `双向链表`

```java
public class LinkedBlockingQueue<E> extends AbstractQueue<E>
        implements BlockingQueue<E>, java.io.Serializable {
    
    // 无限队列
    public LinkedBlockingQueue() {
        this(Integer.MAX_VALUE);
    }

   // 有限队列
    public LinkedBlockingQueue(int capacity) {
        if (capacity <= 0) throw new IllegalArgumentException();
        this.capacity = capacity;
        last = head = new Node<E>(null);
    }
    
    // 实现 "链表" 结构
    static class Node<E> {
        E item;
        Node<E> next;
        Node(E x) { item = x; }
    }
    
    transient Node<E> head;
    private transient Node<E> last;
    
    // 实现 "阻塞" 队列
    private final ReentrantLock takeLock = new ReentrantLock();
    private final Condition notEmpty = takeLock.newCondition();
    private final Condition notFull = putLock.newCondition();
}
```

<BR/>

## put()

**`put()`**

使用 `await() / signal()` 实现阻塞操作

```JAVA
public void put(E e) throws InterruptedException {
        if (e == null) throw new NullPointerException();
        final int c;
        final Node<E> node = new Node<E>(e);
        final ReentrantLock putLock = this.putLock;
        final AtomicInteger count = this.count;
        putLock.lockInterruptibly();
        try {
            while (count.get() == capacity) {
                notFull.await();	// await()
            }
            enqueue(node);	      // enqueue()
            c = count.getAndIncrement();
            if (c + 1 < capacity)
                notFull.signal();
        } finally {
            putLock.unlock();
        }
        if (c == 0)
            signalNotEmpty();	// notEmpty.signal();
    }
```

使用 `enqueue()` 实现链表结构：插入到链表末尾 last

```java
private void enqueue(Node<E> node) {
        last = last.next = node;
    }
```

<BR/>

## take()

**`take()`**

使用 `await() / signal()` 实现阻塞操作

```java
public E take() throws InterruptedException {
    final E x;
    final int c;
    final AtomicInteger count = this.count;
    final ReentrantLock takeLock = this.takeLock;
    takeLock.lockInterruptibly();
    try {
        // await()
        while (count.get() == 0) {
            notEmpty.await();
        }
        // dequeue()
        x = dequeue();
        c = count.getAndDecrement();
        if (c > 1)
            notEmpty.signal();
    } finally {
        takeLock.unlock();
    }
   // signal()
    if (c == capacity)
        signalNotFull();
    return x;
}
```

使用 `dequeue()` 实现链表结构：取出链表头部 head

```java
private E dequeue() {
        Node<E> h = head;			// head 是 null，head.next 才是真正取出的元素
        Node<E> first = h.next;
        h.next = h; // help GC		     // head.next = head，辅助 GC 回收
        head = first;
        E x = first.item;
        first.item = null;
        return x;
    }
```

